        "id": 1491204
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-31T08:25:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Honestly, you have the point. We could have considered a device without address.\nI guess if address is empty, Device Effect check port will match if the address is also empty. It will not however be added to add device of the same type (as a strong match is expected on the address).\n\nSo, if address becomes optional, may check patch relax the strong rule on address to dispatch to all device of this type?",
      "parentUuid": "7bb79cca_b4139c67",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 278,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 279,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "9450bc2908f8f5f92717c6f453c75ea3daa66e32",
